WEBVTT

00:10:28.412 --> 00:10:31.329
And I'm wondering is, is that
a lens that you apply?

00:10:31.371 --> 00:10:34.746
And I guess if you turn it
inward a little bit,

00:10:35.871 --> 00:10:38.454
when you've achieved the level
of success that you have,

00:10:38.579 --> 00:10:42.037
how do you stay desperate to rethink
some of the stories that you tell?

00:10:42.662 --> 00:10:44.162
Well, I have to do is go on Twitter.

00:10:46.662 --> 00:10:52.621
I feel like, you know, I'm always
desperate to do something,

00:10:52.621 --> 00:10:53.912
to tell a story that

00:10:55.662 --> 00:10:59.746
that moves people. And sometimes I'm
more successful than others.

00:10:59.746 --> 00:11:04.454
And, you know, I never go into anything
with a kind of template